h2 About this specification @17,3867,694,21
text This specification is like no other — it has been processed with you, the humble web developer, in mind. @17,3900,694,20
text The focus of this specification is readability and ease of access. Unlike the , this "developer's edition" removes information that only browser vendors need know. It is automatically produced from the full specification by our build tooling, and thus always in sync with the latest developments in HTML. @17,3932,694,61
